  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey, vrchat!\nI was wondering if there was a way to use a phone to play vrchat?\nbut not in the way you might think.\nCould you guys develop an app that allows vrchat to be streamed to a mobile device? with 2 duplicated side by side views so that the phone could be put in a google cardboard, or a third party mobile vr headset, and use the phone's gyroscope to move the head,\nand another app to use multiple phones as hands in vr, with buttons on the screen.\nIt would allow a lot of people that don't own proper vr headsets to play vr in vrchat,\nsay somebody doesn't own 3 phones (who doesn't? lol) they could only use that one phone as a head and use a keyboard to play. this would be a very useful feature to add!\nI hope you add this feature in the future",
